1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,418
You sign in with your clinic
account to open the clinical board.

2
00:00:03,418 --> 00:00:08,760
The overview highlights patients who need
immediate attention and those currently in
the department.

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:13,567
As the shift progresses, recorded
consultations and discharges appear in the
daily ledger.

4
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:17,520
You switch to the ward view to check
bed occupancy and patient placements.

5
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:22,167
The pharmacy board gives an instant count
of stocked medications and items running
low.
